@ In Emerald this HIKER hands over HM05. The import brought the words without
@ the item, and a KANTO champion has FLASH already, so he gives directions.
GraniteCave_1F_Text_H0::
    .string "Hold up. It's black as a pocket\n"
    .string "further in.\p"
    .string "A fellow went down ahead of you\n"
    .string "with a light of his own. STEVEN,\l"
    .string "he said his name was.\p"
    .string "You've the look of someone who\n"
    .string "carries FLASH already, so I'll\l"
    .string "save my breath and give you the\l"
    .string "way instead.\p"
    .string "Down, then left at the water, and\n"
    .string "keep the wall on your right.$"

GraniteCave_1F_TYSharedHM_FreshText::
	.string "It gets pitch-black further in.\p"
	.string "STEVEN went down ahead of you.\n"
	.string "Take this HM to light the way.$"

GraniteCave_1F_TYSharedHM_FreshThanks::
	.string "With BRAWLY's BADGE, FLASH can\n"
	.string "light up HOENN's dark caves.$"

GraniteCave_1F_TYSharedHM_KnownText::
	.string "You already have FLASH.\p"
	.string "That HM will still light the way.\n"
	.string "Try this different technique, too.$"

GraniteCave_1F_TYSharedHM_TechniqueText::
	.string "The TM teaches PSYCHIC.\n"
	.string "Put it to good use in HOENN!$"

GraniteCave_1F_TYSharedHM_FullText::
	.string "Your BAG has no room.\p"
	.string "Make some space, then return.\n"
	.string "I will keep your reward ready.$"

GraniteCave_1F_TYSharedHM_DoneText::
	.string "Use your gifts to find a safe path.\n"
	.string "Good luck looking for STEVEN!$"
